{# Shared create/edit dialog — module spec: "même dialogue pour les deux".
   Deliberately NOT the shared partials/modal.html.twig embed: its header
   carries a dynamic status badge next to the title, which the embed's
   fixed title+close header cannot host. The title id (mm-modal-title)
   and heading level follow the embed's conventions anyway. #}
<div class="modal fade" id="mm-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="mm-modal-title" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-fullscreen-sm-down modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h2 class="modal-title h5" id="mm-modal-title">Nouvel email</h2>
                <span class="badge text-bg-secondary ms-2 d-none" id="mm-status-badge" role="status"></span>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close ms-auto" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fermer"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="alert alert-danger d-none" id="mm-error"></div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label small" for="mm-section">Section expéditrice</label>
                    <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="mm-section"></select>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label small" for="mm-list">Liste de diffusion</label>
                    <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="mm-list"></select>
                    <p class="form-text small mb-0 d-none" id="mm-merge-list-note">
                        Un email par ligne du fichier, contrairement aux listes classiques (un email par adresse).
                    </p>
                    {# Shown in place of the scout-year block for a list contributed by
                       another module (Email::LIST_TYPE_EXTERNAL): its year is fixed by
                       the module that owns it, and Service\MailingListService ignores
                       the year checkboxes for it. Toggled by mass-mail-list.js's
                       updateListTypeUi(), exactly like the mail-merge note above. #}
                    <p class="form-text small mb-0 d-none" id="mm-external-list-note">
                        Cette liste vise toujours l'année d'inscription.
                    </p>
                </div>

                {# Mail-merge audience zone — shown only when the "Publipostage" list type is selected. #}
                <div class="mb-3 d-none" id="mm-merge-zone">
                    <div class="border rounded bg-body-tertiary p-2" id="mm-merge-upload-state">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-center">
                            <input type="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="mm-merge-file" accept=".xlsx"
                                   aria-label="Choisir le fichier Excel du publipostage">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary text-nowrap" id="mm-merge-import-btn">Importer</button>
                        </div>
                        <p class="form-text small mb-0 mt-1">
                            Fichier Excel (.xlsx), première feuille uniquement, première ligne = en-têtes de colonnes.
                            Colonne « Tiers » (identifiant Desk : l'email part vers toutes les adresses connues du membre)
                            et/ou colonne « Email » (adresse libre, plusieurs possibles séparées par « ; »).
                            Chaque colonne devient une variable utilisable dans le sujet et le message.
                            Les exports Excel du site (membres, réponses de formulaire) sont réutilisables tels quels.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="border rounded bg-body-tertiary p-2 d-none" id="mm-merge-info-state">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-spreadsheet fs-4 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <div class="flex-grow-1">
                                <div class="small fw-semibold" id="mm-merge-filename"></div>
                                <div class="form-text small mt-0" id="mm-merge-meta"></div>
                            </div>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary text-nowrap d-none" id="mm-merge-replace-btn">Remplacer…</button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-1 mt-2" id="mm-merge-columns"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="alert alert-warning small py-2 mt-2 mb-0 d-none" id="mm-merge-warnings"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3" id="mm-scout-year-zone">
                    <div class="form-label small d-block">Année(s) scoute(s)</div>
                    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3" id="mm-scout-year-group"></div>
                    <p class="form-text small mb-1">
                        Plusieurs années peuvent être sélectionnées à la fois : les listes correspondantes sont
                        fusionnées et dédupliquées par adresse, pour n'envoyer qu'un seul email par personne — utile
                        par exemple pour inviter d'anciens et de nouveaux membres à un même événement (montage dias
                        de fin d'année, retrouvailles...).
                    </p>
                    <p class="form-text small mb-0" id="mm-previous-year-note"></p>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label small" for="mm-subject">Sujet</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="mm-subject">
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <div class="form-label small">Message</div>
                    <div class="rich-text-toolbar mb-2" id="mm-body-toolbar">
                        <button type="button" data-command="formatBlock" data-value="h2" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Titre 2"><strong>H2</strong></button>
                        <button type="button" data-command="formatBlock" data-value="h3" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Titre 3"><strong>H3</strong></button>
                        <button type="button" data-command="formatBlock" data-value="p" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Paragraphe" aria-label="Paragraphe"><i class="bi bi-text-paragraph" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        <span class="mx-1"></span>
                        <button type="button" data-command="bold" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Gras" aria-label="Gras"><i class="bi bi-type-bold" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        <button type="button" data-command="italic" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Italique" aria-label="Italique"><i class="bi bi-type-italic" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        <button type="button" data-command="underline" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Souligné" aria-label="Souligné"><i class="bi bi-type-underline" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        <span class="mx-1"></span>
                        <button type="button" data-command="insertUnorderedList" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Liste à puces" aria-label="Liste à puces"><i class="bi bi-list-ul" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        <button type="button" data-command="insertOrderedList" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Liste numérotée" aria-label="Liste numérotée"><i class="bi bi-list-ol" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        <span class="mx-1"></span>
                        <button type="button" data-command="createLink" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Lien" aria-label="Lien"><i class="bi bi-link-45deg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        <button type="button" data-command="removeFormat" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Supprimer le formatage" aria-label="Supprimer le formatage"><i class="bi bi-eraser" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        <span class="mx-1"></span>
                        <div class="dropdown d-none" id="mm-variable-dropdown">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary dropdown-toggle" data-bs-toggle="dropdown"
                                    title="Insérer une variable du fichier de publipostage">
                                <i class="bi bi-braces" aria-hidden="true"></i> Variable
                            </button>
                            <ul class="dropdown-menu" id="mm-variable-menu"></ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="mm-body-content" contenteditable="true" class="form-control" style="min-height:180px;"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <div class="form-label small d-block">Pièces jointes</div>
                    <div id="mm-attachments-list" class="d-flex flex-column gap-1 mb-2"></div>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2" id="mm-attachment-upload-zone">
                        <input type="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="mm-attachment-file" aria-label="Choisir un fichier à joindre">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary text-nowrap" id="mm-attachment-upload-btn">Ajouter</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-text small" id="mm-attachment-hint">Enregistrez d'abord le brouillon pour ajouter des pièces jointes.</div>
                </div>

                <div class="d-none" id="mm-progress-zone" role="status">
                    <div class="form-label small d-block">Progression de l'envoi</div>
                    <div class="progress mb-2" style="height: 1.25rem;">
                        <div class="progress-bar bg-success" id="mm-progress-sent" style="width:0%"></div>
                        <div class="progress-bar bg-danger" id="mm-progress-error" style="width:0%"></div>
                        <div class="progress-bar bg-secondary" id="mm-progress-pending" style="width:0%"></div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="small text-body-secondary" id="mm-progress-text"></p>
                    <a href="#" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="mm-tracking-link">Voir le suivi détaillé</a>
                </div>

                {# Mail-merge per-recipient preview — test mode only. #}
                <div class="d-none border-top pt-3" id="mm-merge-preview-zone">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                        <div class="form-label small mb-0">Aperçu par destinataire</div>
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-1 ms-auto">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="mm-merge-prev-btn" title="Ligne précédente" aria-label="Ligne précédente"><i class="bi bi-chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                            <span class="small text-body-secondary text-nowrap" id="mm-merge-preview-position"></span>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="mm-merge-next-btn" title="Ligne suivante" aria-label="Ligne suivante"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-2" id="mm-merge-preview-recipient"></p>
                    <div class="alert alert-warning small py-2 d-none" id="mm-merge-preview-warnings"></div>
                    <div class="border rounded mb-2">
                        <div class="px-2 py-1 border-bottom bg-body-tertiary small"><span class="text-body-secondary">Sujet :</span> <strong id="mm-merge-preview-subject"></strong></div>
                        <div class="p-2 small" id="mm-merge-preview-body"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="d-none border-top pt-3" id="mm-test-send-zone">
                    <label class="form-label small" for="mm-test-send-email">Envoyer un email de test à</label>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                        <input type="email" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="mm-test-send-email">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary text-nowrap" id="mm-test-send-btn">Envoyer le test</button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="form-text small mb-0 d-none" id="mm-test-send-merge-note">Le test est envoyé avec les valeurs de la ligne affichée dans l'aperçu ci-dessus.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Fermer</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary d-none" id="mm-to-draft-btn">Retour au brouillon</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary d-none" id="mm-save-btn">Enregistrer</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-warning d-none" id="mm-to-test-btn">Passer en mode test</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-danger d-none" id="mm-start-sending-btn">Lancer l'envoi</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
